OL,3,GNEWSAHunger Games fan, 13, to get
OL,4,Aartwork shown on cinema screens before
OL,5,Afilm
OL,6,
OL,7,FA teenage Hunger Games fan has met the
OL,8,Fcast of the new film after her artwork
OL,9,Fwon a competition, meaning it will be
OL,10,Fdisplayed at every cinema screening
OL,11,Facross the UK.
OL,13,FFreja Brown, 13, won the British Board
OL,14,Fof Film Classification's (BBFC) create
OL,15,Fthe card competition, which ran ahead
OL,16,Fof the release of The Hunger Games:
OL,17,FSunrise on the Reaping - the sixth film
OL,18,Fin the franchise.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
