OL,3,GNEWSAHunger Games fan, 13, to get
OL,4,Aartwork shown on cinema screens before
OL,5,Afilm
OL,6,
OL,7,FFreja, from Cardiff, beat more than
OL,8,F1,000 entries from across the UK and
OL,9,Fsaid she was "so grateful" to be
OL,10,Fchosen.
OL,12,FHer design will be the official BBFC
OL,13,Fblack card, which displays the age
OL,14,Frating and classification details of
OL,15,Fthe film before every cinema showing.
